    "OPN Report Kit — a free community tool for creating clear, neutral Steam reports. Select and combine observed behaviours, copy the report text, and keep a daily farming-bot list.": "OPN Report Kit——用于生成清晰、中立 Steam 举报的免费社区工具。选择并组合观察到的行为，复制举报文本，并维护每日刷取机器人列表。",
