    "Open Play Network standard report templates for Steam community reports.": "Open Play Network 为 Steam 社区举报提供的标准模板。",
    "Create clear, neutral Steam reports and combine every behaviour you observed.": "生成清晰、中立的 Steam 举报，并组合所有观察到的行为。",
    "Suspected wallhack: the player repeatedly appeared to track opponents through walls and reacted to positions without clear visual or audible information.": "疑似透视：玩家似乎多次隔墙跟踪对手，并在没有明确视觉或声音信息的情况下对其位置作出反应。",
    "Suspicious awareness and possible wall tracking observed.": "观察到可疑的意识和可能穿过墙壁跟踪对手的情况。",
    "Suspected aim assistance: the player showed repeated unnatural target snaps and unusually precise reactions across multiple encounters.": "疑似辅助瞄准：玩家在多次交锋中反复出现不自然的瞬间转向目标，以及异常精准的反应。",
    "Possible aim assistance observed.": "观察到可能的瞄准辅助。",
    "Suspected low-FOV or soft aim assistance: the crosshair made repeated subtle corrections toward targets, producing unusually consistent precision without obvious full snaps.": "疑似轻微辅助瞄准或小范围 FOV 辅助：准星反复向目标细微修正，精度异常稳定，但没有明显的大幅瞬间转向。",
    "Possible soft aim or low-FOV aim assistance observed.": "观察到可能存在软瞄准或低视场瞄准辅助。",
    "Suspected triggerbot: shots repeatedly fired at the exact moment an opponent crossed the player's crosshair, with reaction timing that appeared automated.": "疑似自动开火：对手经过玩家准星的准确瞬间反复触发射击，反应时机看起来像自动控制。",
