    "Possible radar assistance observed.": "观察到可能有雷达辅助。",
    "Suspected recoil or spray-control script: repeated weapon sprays showed absent or unnaturally consistent recoil correction.": "疑似后坐力或压枪脚本：多次连续射击中，后坐力修正缺失或呈现不自然的一致性。",
