    "Brought an outstanding attitude that lifted the team throughout the match.": "在整场比赛中展现出出色的态度，为队伍带来了动力。",
    "Positive": "积极",
    "Maintained a positive, constructive attitude throughout the match.": "在整场比赛中保持着积极、建设性的态度。",
    "Neutral": "中立",
    "Had a neutral attitude that did not noticeably affect the match.": "态度中立，并未对比赛产生明显影响。",
    "Negative": "消极",
    "Maintained a negative attitude that made the match harder for others.": "保持消极态度，导致其他人的比赛变得更加困难。",
    "Absent": "缺失",
    "Showed no constructive attitude or engagement during the match.": "在比赛中没有表现出建设性的态度或参与度。",
    "Toxic": "恶劣",
    "Used insults or intense hostility that seriously damaged the team's experience.": "使用侮辱或强烈的敌意，严重损害了队伍的经验。",
    "Skilled play": "操作水平",
